const categories=[{name:"News",desc:"Company and product updates"},{name:"Architectures",desc:"System maps and technical blueprints"},{name:"Engineering",desc:"Build notes and implementation insights"},{name:"Patch Notes",desc:"Releases, improvements and fixes"},{name:"Policies",desc:"Trust, privacy and responsible technology",children:["Terms and Agreement","Data and Privacy for VANT Applications","Child Cyber Safety","Policy on AI Exponential","Cookies and Technology"]},{name:"Guides & Resources",desc:"Product guides, tutorials and references",children:["Product guides and getting started","Technical references and glossary","Research perspectives and reading lists"]}];
export default function VANTLibraryWorkspace(){const [category,setCategory]=useState("News");const [query,setQuery]=useState("");const [selected,setSelected]=useState("news-ecosystem");const [mobileList,setMobileList]=useState(false);const [readingProgress,setReadingProgress]=useState(0);const readerRef=useRef<HTMLElement|null>(null);const current=docs.find(d=>d.id===selected)??docs[0];const currentMeta=documentMeta[current.id];useEffect(()=>{const update=()=>{const el=readerRef.current;if(!el){setReadingProgress(0);return;}const rect=el.getBoundingClientRect();const top=window.scrollY+rect.top;const height=Math.max(el.scrollHeight-window.innerHeight,1);setReadingProgress(Math.max(0,Math.min(100,Math.round(((window.scrollY-top)/height)*100))));};update();window.addEventListener("scroll",update,{passive:true});window.addEventListener("resize",update);return()=>{window.removeEventListener("scroll",update);window.removeEventListener("resize",update);};},[selected]);const jumpToSection=(index:number)=>{document.getElementById("vt-library-section-"+index)?.scrollIntoView({behavior:"smooth",block:"start"});};const filtered=useMemo(()=>docs.filter(d=>(category==="All"||d.category===category)&&(!query.trim()||[d.title,d.summary,d.type,d.category,...d.sections.flatMap(s=>[s.heading,...(s.paragraphs??[]),...(s.bullets??[])])].join(" ").toLowerCase().includes(query.toLowerCase()))),[category,query]);const chooseCategory=(name:string)=>{setCategory(name);setMobileList(false);const next=docs.find(d=>name==="All"||d.category===name);if(next)setSelected(next.id);};return <section className="vt-library-workspace" aria-label="VANT Libraries workspace"><aside className="vt-library-sidebar"><div className="vt-library-sidebar-heading"><span>LIBRARY INDEX</span><b>V.01</b></div><label className="vt-library-search"><span>⌕</span><input value={query} onChange={e=>setQuery(e.target.value)} placeholder="Search the library..." aria-label="Search VANT Libraries"/>{query&&<button onClick={()=>setQuery("")} aria-label="Clear search">×</button>}</label><nav className="vt-library-categories" aria-label="Library categories"><button className={category==="All"?"is-active":""} onClick={()=>chooseCategory("All")}><span>All resources</span><small>{docs.length.toString().padStart(2,"0")}</small></button>{categories.map((item,index)=><div className="vt-library-category-group" key={item.name}><button className={category===item.name?"is-active":""} onClick={()=>chooseCategory(item.name)}><span><i>{String(index+1).padStart(2,"0")}</i>{item.name}</span><small>{docs.filter(d=>d.category===item.name).length.toString().padStart(2,"0")}</small></button>{item.children&&category===item.name&&<div className="vt-library-subcategories">{item.children.map(child=><button key={child} onClick={()=>{const found=docs.find(d=>d.title===child);if(found)setSelected(found.id);}} className={current.title===child?"is-current":""}>{child}</button>)}</div>}</div>)}</nav><div className="vt-library-sidebar-note"><span>VANT TECHNOLOGIES</span><small>Knowledge, connected.</small></div></aside><div className="vt-library-main"><div className="vt-library-results"><div className="vt-library-results-top"><div><span>VANT LIBRARIES / {category.toUpperCase()}</span><h2>{category==="All"?"All resources":category}</h2><p>{categories.find(c=>c.name===category)?.desc??"Explore the VANT knowledge ecosystem."}</p></div><span className="vt-library-count">{filtered.length.toString().padStart(2,"0")} ITEMS</span></div><div className="vt-library-result-list">{filtered.map((doc,index)=><button key={doc.id} className={"vt-library-result"+(selected===doc.id?" is-selected":"")} onClick={()=>{setSelected(doc.id);setMobileList(false);}}><span className="vt-library-result-number">{String(index+1).padStart(2,"0")}</span><span className="vt-library-result-copy"><small>{doc.type}</small><b>{doc.title}</b><em>{doc.summary}</em></span><span className="vt-library-result-arrow">↗</span></button>)}{filtered.length===0&&<div className="vt-library-empty">No resources match that search. Try another term or category.</div>}</div></div><article className="vt-library-reader" ref={readerRef}><div className="vt-library-reading-track" aria-label={"Reading progress "+readingProgress+" percent"}><span style={{width:readingProgress+"%"}}/></div><header className="vt-library-reader-toolbar"><div className="vt-library-reader-brand">VANT <span>/ DOCUMENT VIEWER</span></div><span className="vt-library-reader-state">LIBRARY DOCUMENT</span></header><div className="vt-library-reader-paper"><div className="vt-library-reader-meta"><span>{current.type}</span><span>{current.status??"VANT LIBRARIES"}</span></div><h2>{current.title}</h2><div className="vt-library-reader-byline">{current.date}</div><div className="vt-library-document-meta"><span>VERSION {documentMeta[current.id]?.version??"1.0"}</span><span>UPDATED {documentMeta[current.id]?.updated??"30 OCT 2026"}</span><span>BY {documentMeta[current.id]?.author??"VANT TECHNOLOGIES"}</span></div><div className="vt-library-publication-row"><span className={"vt-library-status is-"+(currentMeta?.status??"Published").toLowerCase().replace(" ","-")}>{currentMeta?.status??"Published"}</span><span className="vt-library-reading-label">{readingProgress}% READ</span></div><div className="vt-library-reader-rule"/><p className="vt-library-reader-summary">{current.summary}</p><nav className="vt-library-toc" aria-label="Document contents"><div><span>ON THIS PAGE</span><small>{current.sections.length.toString().padStart(2,"0")} SECTIONS</small></div><ol>{current.sections.map((section,i)=><li key={i}><button onClick={()=>jumpToSection(i)}>{String(i+1).padStart(2,"0")} <span>{section.heading}</span></button></li>)}</ol></nav><div className="vt-library-reader-body">{current.sections.map((section,i)=><section className="vt-library-reader-section" id={"vt-library-section-"+i} key={i}><h3>{section.heading}</h3>{section.paragraphs?.map((paragraph,j)=><p key={j}>{paragraph}</p>)}{section.bullets&&<ul>{section.bullets.map((item,j)=><li key={j}>{item}</li>)}</ul>}</section>)}</div><div className="vt-library-document-panels"><section className="vt-library-history"><div className="vt-library-panel-heading"><span>REVISION HISTORY</span><small>{currentMeta?.history.length??1} RECORDS</small></div>{(currentMeta?.history??[]).map((revision,i)=><div className="vt-library-revision" key={i}><b>v{revision.version}</b><span>{revision.date}</span><p>{revision.note}</p></div>)}<p className="vt-library-panel-note">Earlier revision records are not available in this initial Library release.</p></section><section className="vt-library-editorial"><div className="vt-library-panel-heading"><span>EDITORIAL WORKFLOW</span><small>{currentMeta?.status??"Published"}</small></div><ol>{(currentMeta?.workflow??[]).map((stage,i)=><li className={stage.done?"is-done":""} key={i}><i>{stage.done?"✓":String(i+1).padStart(2,"0")}</i>{stage.label}</li>)}</ol><p className="vt-library-panel-note">Publication status is editorial metadata. Formal team approvals and shared publishing controls require an authenticated editorial service.</p></section></div><div className="vt-library-related"><div className="vt-library-related-heading"><span>CONTINUE EXPLORING</span><small>RELATED DOCUMENTS</small></div><div className="vt-library-related-list">{(documentMeta[current.id]?.related??[]).map(id=>docs.find(doc=>doc.id===id)).filter((doc):doc is LibraryDoc=>Boolean(doc)).map(doc=><button key={doc.id} onClick={()=>{setSelected(doc.id);setCategory(doc.category);setMobileList(false);}}><span>{doc.category.toUpperCase()}</span><b>{doc.title}</b><i>↗</i></button>)}</div></div><footer><span>RELATED COLLECTION · {current.category.toUpperCase()}</span><span>VANT TECHNOLOGIES ↗</span></footer></div></article></div></section>}
